# Root .gitignore for India Local Problems Portal

### Environment Variables ###
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.env.local
.env.production
.env.staging
.env.development

### Sensitive Files ###
*password*
*secret*
*token*
*credential*
*api-key*
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.cer
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks

### IDE ###
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr
.project
.classpath
.settings/

### OS Files ###
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
*~

### Logs ###
logs/
*.log
*.log.*
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*

### Temporary Files ###
*.tmp
*.temp
*.swp
*.swo
.cache

### Backup Files ###
*.bak
*.backup
*.old
*.orig

### Build Artifacts ###
target/
build/
dist/
node_modules/

### Uploads ###
uploads/
**/uploads/

### Docker Volumes ###
docker-volumes/

### Database Files ###
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

### Documentation (if generated) ###
docs/generated/
api-docs/

### Coverage Reports ###
coverage/
*.coverage
.nyc_output/

### Package Manager ###
.pnpm-store
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/sdks
!.yarn/versions

### Test Files ###
*.test.local.*
test-results/

### Local Development ###
local.properties
dev.properties
local-config.json
dev-config.json

### SSL Certificates ###
certificates/
ssl/
certs/*.pem
certs/*.key
